OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloud will feed across the
OL,6,Fregion from the northwest today, with
OL,7,Fa small chance of a shower breaking
OL,8,Fout. Skies will brighten again from
OL,9,Fthe north later this afternoon, with
OL,10,Fdry and sunny spells. Feeling much
OL,11,Ffresher than of late.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAny remaining showers will
OL,14,Fease overnight, leaving a mostly clear
OL,15,Fand dry night to come. Feeling rather
OL,16,Fcool compared to recent nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
