OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA dry and bright start to
OL,6,FFriday with plenty of sunny spells.
OL,7,FCloud builds through the morning,
OL,8,Fleading to a few isolated showers in
OL,9,Fthe north. Fresher than recent days.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FThough
OL,12,Fremaining a little cooler and fresher,
OL,13,Fthere will be some warm spells of
OL,14,Fsunshine at times, but an isolated
OL,15,Fshower possible. Possibly turning
OL,16,Fwetter on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
